{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45404","headline":"山月行 · 皎然","name":"山月行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家家望秋月，不及秋山望。\n山中万境长寂寥，夜夜孤明我山上。\n海人皆言生海东，山人自谓出山中。\n忧虞欢乐皆占月，月本无心同不同。\n自从有月山不改，古人望尽今人在。\n不知万世今夜时，孤月将□谁更待。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45404.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45404","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}